# The rail's Recent filtered to "orders", with hits from two other hosts and one that sleeps.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
project storefront line-shop
host mac-mini
host ci-runner
host nas
saved here "Check the overnight orders"
saved here "Refund flow for split orders"
saved mac-mini "Backfill orders table"
saved ci-runner "Slow orders query"
settle 4
asleep nas
click "Filter recent chats"
type "orders" 40
wait 1
snap recent-hosts-arriving
settle 5
snap recent-hosts-settled
